1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,840
IN 1859,

2
00:00:01,840 --> 00:00:02,740
AMERICA AND BRITAIN

3
00:00:02,740 --> 00:00:03,880
NEARLY WENT TO WAR.

4
00:00:03,880 --> 00:00:05,086
OVER A PIG.

5
00:00:05,520 --> 00:00:07,260
THEIR 1846 TREATY

6
00:00:07,260 --> 00:00:08,280
PUT THE BORDER

7
00:00:08,280 --> 00:00:09,000
DOWN THE MIDDLE

8
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:09,841
OF THE CHANNEL.

9
00:00:10,220 --> 00:00:10,520
THERE WERE

10
00:00:10,420 --> 00:00:11,580
TWO CHANNELS.

11
00:00:11,580 --> 00:00:12,460
BOTH COUNTRIES CLAIMED

12
00:00:12,460 --> 00:00:13,981
THE ISLANDS IN BETWEEN.

13
00:00:14,481 --> 00:00:16,000
ON SAN JUAN ISLAND,

14
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:16,900
AN AMERICAN FARMER

15
00:00:16,900 --> 00:00:17,720
FOUND A BRITISH

16
00:00:17,720 --> 00:00:18,540
COMPANY'S PIG

17
00:00:18,540 --> 00:00:19,680
IN HIS GARDEN.

18
00:00:19,680 --> 00:00:20,458
HE SHOT IT.

19
00:00:20,758 --> 00:00:22,180
HE OFFERED $10.

20
00:00:22,180 --> 00:00:22,640
THE OWNER

21
00:00:22,640 --> 00:00:24,138
WANTED $100.

22
00:00:24,588 --> 00:00:25,140
BRITAIN THREATENED

23
00:00:25,140 --> 00:00:26,220
TO ARREST HIM.

24
00:00:26,220 --> 00:00:27,400
SO THE US ARMY

25
00:00:27,400 --> 00:00:29,426
LANDED 64 SOLDIERS.

26
00:00:29,726 --> 00:00:30,500
BRITAIN SENT

27
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:31,362
WARSHIPS.

28
00:00:31,800 --> 00:00:32,286
WITHIN WEEKS,

29
00:00:32,286 --> 00:00:34,120
461 AMERICANS

30
00:00:34,120 --> 00:00:35,280
FACED FIVE

31
00:00:35,280 --> 00:00:36,341
BRITISH WARSHIPS.

32
00:00:36,680 --> 00:00:37,840
THEN THE BRITISH ADMIRAL

33
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:39,260
REFUSED TO START A WAR

34
00:00:39,260 --> 00:00:40,200
OVER A SQUABBLE

35
00:00:40,200 --> 00:00:41,220
ABOUT A PIG.

36
00:00:41,670 --> 00:00:42,440
SO BOTH ARMIES

37
00:00:42,440 --> 00:00:43,160
JUST STAYED.

38
00:00:43,160 --> 00:00:44,557
FOR 12 YEARS.

39
00:00:45,020 --> 00:00:46,600
IN 1872,

40
00:00:46,600 --> 00:00:47,480
THE GERMAN KAISER

41
00:00:47,480 --> 00:00:48,640
SETTLED IT.

42
00:00:48,640 --> 00:00:49,300
AMERICA GOT

43
00:00:49,300 --> 00:00:50,098
THE ISLANDS.

44
00:00:50,560 --> 00:00:51,300
TOTAL CASUALTIES

45
00:00:51,300 --> 00:00:52,520
OF THE WAR:

46
00:00:52,520 --> 00:00:53,204
ONE PIG.

